"bm_george|auditor. A person whose job is to check, independently, whether a company or a system is doing what it says.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|households. Homes, counting everyone who lives together in each one.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|prescriptions. Doctors\u2019 orders for medicines.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
