"bm_george|commission. Money paid to someone every time they send a sale your way.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|steering. Quietly pushing people toward one choice, often because it helps the one doing the pushing.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|steered. Pushed toward one choice on purpose.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|mystery shopper. A tester who shops like a normal customer, so the store or AI doesn\u2019t know it is being checked.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
