"bm_george|independent. Not run by, or paid by, the people being checked.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|autopilot. Letting a machine run something without checking on it.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|bargain hunters. Shoppers who compare prices carefully to get the best deal.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|parent company. A company that owns other companies.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
